{"suttaId":"sn45.38","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-v","vriCode":"s0305m.mul","paras":[157,157],"vripara":"38"},"segments":{"sn45.38:0.3":"Dutiyabrahmaññasuttaṃ","sn45.38:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn45.38:1.2":"“Brahmaññañca vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi, brahmaññatthañca.","sn45.38:1.3":"Taṃ suṇātha.","sn45.38:1.4":"Katamañca, bhikkhave, brahmaññaṃ?","sn45.38:1.5":"Ayameva ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo, seyyathidaṃ – sammādiṭṭhi … pe … sammāsamādhi.","sn45.38:1.7":"Idaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, brahmaññaṃ.","sn45.38:1.8":"Katamo ca, bhikkhave, brahmaññattho?","sn45.38:1.9":"Yo kho, bhikkhave, rāgakkhayo dosakkhayo mohakkhayo – ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, brahmaññattho”ti.","sn45.38:1.11":"Aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
